<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">产品名称 *</text><input class="input" value="{{product.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">产品类型 *</text><picker range="{{types}}" range-key="name" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="type"><view class="picker">{{types[typeIndex].name}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">包含课时</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{product.lessonCount}}" data-key="lessonCount" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">售价（元） *</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{product.price}}" data-key="price" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">有效期（天，0为不限）</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{product.validityDays}}" data-key="validityDays" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">适用班级类型</text><input class="input" value="{{classTypesText}}" placeholder="如：REGULAR、ELITE" data-key="classTypesText" bindinput="applicability"/><view class="muted small">多个类型用逗号或顿号分隔，留空表示不限。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">适用年龄组</text><input class="input" value="{{ageGroupsText}}" placeholder="如：U8、U10" data-key="ageGroupsText" bindinput="applicability"/><view class="muted small">多个年龄组用逗号或顿号分隔，留空表示不限。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">说明</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{product.description}}" data-key="description" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="between"><text>上架销售</text><switch checked="{{product.active}}" bindchange="active" color="#12643b"/></view></view><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存产品</button></view>
